  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "No suitable optimization is supported for this workflow. The workflow already caches Maven dependencies via `setup-java` with `cache: 'maven'` (P-LIT-GHA-CACHE), already bounds the job with `timeout-minutes: 20` (P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT), and already filters push triggers by ignored paths (P-LIT-CHANGE-FILTER). History-dependent timeout optimizations (P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT derivation, P-LIT-HISTORY-TIMEOUT) cannot be applied because CI history shows no completed runs. There is no matrix for P-LIT-FAIL-FAST, no scheduled triggers for P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE or P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE, and the uploaded jars are apparent deliverables whose consumers are not confirmed unused, so P-LIT-UNUSED-OUTPUTS cannot be safely applied. No new network access, secrets, privileged actions, or publishing/deployment operations are introduced.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT", "P-LIT-HISTORY-TIMEOUT", "P-LIT-CHANGE-FILTER", "P-LIT-UNUSED-OUTPUTS", "P-LIT-FAIL-FAST", "P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE", "P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE"]
}
